    "steps": [
      "Preheat the waffle iron to its second-highest setting.",
      "Stir the lemon juice into the almond milk in a small bowl. Let it stand for a few minutes until slightly curdled.",
      "Whisk the flour, flax meal, baking powder, cane sugar, cinnamon and sea salt together in a medium bowl.",
      "Whisk the vanilla and melted coconut oil into the soured milk.",
      "Pour the wet mixture into the dry and stir briefly until barely combined. Leave the lumps and avoid overmixing.",
